      "Rapid progression of symptoms over days"
    ]
  },
  "differentialDiagnoses": [
    {
      "diseaseId": "serotonin-syndrome",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Hyperreflexia and clonus more prominent in serotonin syndrome",
        "Onset usually within hours of serotonergic agent exposure",
        "Diarrhea more common in serotonin syndrome"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "malignant-hyperthermia",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Triggered by anesthetic agents rather than neuroleptics",
        "Muscle rigidity and hyperthermia during anesthesia",
        "Genetic predisposition with mutations in RYR1 gene"
      ]
    }
  ],
